# Records the ktflash TUI "demo" journey → assets/demo.gif
Output demo.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Padding 22
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Hide
Type "export PATH=/tmp:$PATH; clear"
Enter
Show

Type "ktflash demo"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 9s
Type "q"
Sleep 800ms
